<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Denis Vazyula - iOS Developer & B2B Sales Professional</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Results-driven professional combining extensive leadership experience in B2B Tech Sales with proven hands-on expertise in iOS Mobile Development.">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: white;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        /* Language Switcher */
        .lang-switcher {
            position: fixed;
            top: 24px;
            right: 24px;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .lang-btn {
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .lang-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 128px 24px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 25%;
            left: 25%;
            width: 400px;
            height: 400px;
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(80px);
            animation: pulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .hero::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 25%;
            right: 25%;
            width: 400px;
            height: 400px;
            background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(80px);
            animation: pulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
            animation-delay: 1s;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1); }
            50% { opacity: 0.8; transform: scale(1.1); }
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 800px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 80px);
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #3b82f6 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .hero .title {
            font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 36px);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #a855f7 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .hero .location {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .hero .tagline-box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .hero .tagline {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .hero .description {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .hero .cta {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 16px 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #a855f7 100%);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        }

        .hero .cta:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
        }

        /* Section Styles */
        section {
            padding: 128px 24px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 48px);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 64px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Skills Section */
        .skills-section {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, white 0%, #f8fafc 100%);
        }

        .skills-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 32px;
        }

        .skill-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 32px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .skill-card:hover {
            transform: scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .skill-card h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .skill-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .skill-tag {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: white;
        }

        .gradient-blue { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #06b6d4 100%); }
        .gradient-purple { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7 0%, #ec4899 100%); }
        .gradient-green { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #22c55e 0%, #10b981 100%); }
        .gradient-orange { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316 0%, #ef4444 100%); }

        /* Projects Section */
        .projects-section {
            background: #f8fafc;
        }

        .project-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .project-card h3 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .project-card .role {
            font-size: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #a855f7 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .project-card .app-store-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: #000;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .project-card .app-store-link:hover {
            transform: scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .project-card .app-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #a855f7 100%);
            border-radius: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        }

        .project-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .project-list li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            padding-left: 0;
        }

        .project-list li::before {
            content: none;
        }

        .project-number {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #a855f7 100%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-right: 16px;
        }

        /* Experience Section */
        .experience-section {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fafc 0%, white 100%);
        }

        .experience-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .experience-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .experience-header h3 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .experience-header .role {
            font-size: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #a855f7 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .experience-period {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: #dbeafe;
            color: #1e40af;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .experience-description {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        /* Education & Languages */
        .education-section {
            background: white;
        }

        .two-column {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 32px;
        }

        .info-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eff6ff 0%, #faf5ff 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .info-card h3 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .info-card .degree {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .info-card .school {
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .info-card .period {
            color: #999;
        }

        .language-item {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        /* Contact Section */
        .contact-section {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, white 0%, #f8fafc 100%);
        }

        .contact-grid {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .contact-item {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: block;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .contact-item:hover {
            transform: scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .contact-item .label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .contact-item .value {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .contact-item:hover .value {
            color: #3b82f6;
        }

        .contact-location {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #a855f7 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .contact-location .label {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        }

        .contact-location .value {
            color: white;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            color: #999;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 48px 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
        }

        /* RTL Support */
        [dir="rtl"] {
            direction: rtl;
        }

        [dir="rtl"] .project-number,
        [dir="rtl"] .lang-switcher {
            margin-right: 0;
            margin-left: 16px;
        }

        [dir="rtl"] .lang-switcher {
            right: auto;
            left: 24px;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero {
                padding: 64px 16px;
            }

            section {
                padding: 64px 16px;
            }

            .hero .tagline-box {
                padding: 24px;
            }

            .skill-card,
            .project-card,
            .experience-card,
            .info-card {
                padding: 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="lang-switcher">
        <button class="lang-btn" onclick="toggleLanguage()">עברית</button>
    </div>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1 data-en="Denis Vazyula" data-he="דניס וזיולה">Denis Vazyula</h1>
            <p class="title" data-en="iOS Developer & B2B Sales Professional" data-he="מפתח iOS ומומחה מכירות B2B">iOS Developer & B2B Sales Professional</p>
            <p class="location" data-en="Kiryat Motzkin, Israel" data-he="קריית מוצקין, ישראל">Kiryat Motzkin, Israel</p>
            
            <div class="tagline-box">
                <h2 class="tagline" data-en="Bridging Engineering & Business Excellence" data-he="מגשר בין הנדסה למצוינות עסקית">Bridging Engineering & Business Excellence</h2>
                <p class="description" data-en="Results-driven professional combining extensive leadership experience in B2B Tech Sales with proven hands-on expertise in iOS Mobile Development. Successfully built and deployed production-ready 3D graphics applications from scratch." data-he="איש מקצוע ממוקד תוצאות המשלב ניסיון נרחב בניהול במכירות B2B עם מומחיות מוכחת בפיתוח אפליקציות iOS. בנה ופרס בהצלחה אפליקציות גרפיקה תלת-ממדית מוכנות לייצור מאפס.">Results-driven professional combining extensive leadership experience in B2B Tech Sales with proven hands-on expertise in iOS Mobile Development. Successfully built and deployed production-ready 3D graphics applications from scratch.</p>
            </div>
            
            <a href="mailto:vazden@icloud.com" class="cta" data-en="Get in Touch" data-he="צור קשר">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="skills-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title" data-en="Key Skills" data-he="כישורים מרכזיים">Key Skills</h2>
            <div class="skills-grid">
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <h3 data-en="Tech & Frameworks" data-he="טכנולוגיות ומסגרות">Tech & Frameworks</h3>
                    <div class="skill-tags">
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-blue">Swift</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-blue">SwiftUI</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-blue">SceneKit</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-blue">Python</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-blue">C++</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-blue">SQL</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <h3 data-en="Methodologies" data-he="מתודולוגיות">Methodologies</h3>
                    <div class="skill-tags">
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-purple">Business Analysis</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-purple">Product Management</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-purple">BPMN 2.0</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-purple">UML</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <h3 data-en="Domain Expertise" data-he="תחומי מומחיות">Domain Expertise</h3>
                    <div class="skill-tags">
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-green">Sales Analysis</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-green">Revenue Strategy</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-green">3D Graphics</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <h3 data-en="Core Attributes" data-he="תכונות ליבה">Core Attributes</h3>
                    <div class="skill-tags">
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-orange">AI-friendly</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag gradient-orange">Fast Learner</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="projects-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title" data-en="Featured Project" data-he="פרויקט מוביל">Featured Project</h2>
            <div class="project-card">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <img src="forma3d-icon.png" alt="Forma3D App Icon" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3); object-fit: cover;">
                    <div style="flex: 1;">
                        <h3 data-en="Forma3D — 3D Modeling iOS Application" data-he="Forma3D — אפליקציית מידול תלת-ממדי ל-iOS">Forma3D — 3D Modeling iOS Application</h3>
                        <p class="role" data-en="Solo iOS Developer" data-he="מפתח iOS עצמאי">Solo iOS Developer</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <a href="https://apps.apple.com/il/app/forma3d/id6762095429" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 24px; background: #000; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.3s ease; margin-bottom: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                        <path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 3.37.48.33.95.49 1.49.49 2.07 0 .91-.54 1.76-1.49 2.07-1.34.92-2.22 2.13-3.05 3.37-.29.43-.5-.9-.5-1.4 0-.51.21-1.01.57-1.49.07-.58.16-1.16.01-1.64-.49-.92-2.45-2.13-3.37-3.05-.43-.29-.9-.5-1.4-.5-.51 0-1.01.21-1.49.57-.58.07-1.16-.01-1.64.49-.92 2.45-2.13 3.37-3.05.29-.43.5-.9.5-1.4 0-.51-.21-1.01-.57-1.49-.07-.58-.16-1.16-.01-1.64.49-1.24.83-2.45 1.71-3.37 3.05-.33.48-.49.95-.49 1.49 0 .91.54 1.76 1.49 2.07 1.34.92 2.22 2.13 3.05 3.37.43.29.9.5 1.4.5.51 0 1.01-.21 1.49-.57.58-.07 1.16-.01 1.64-.49.92-2.45 2.13-3.37 3.05-.29.43-.5.9-.5 1.4 0 .51.21 1.01.57 1.49.07.58.16 1.16.01 1.64-.49 1.24-.83 2.45-1.71 3.37-3.05.48-.33.95-.49 1.49-.49.91 0 1.76-.54 2.07-1.49zM12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm0 18c-4.41 0-8-3.59-8-8s3.59-8 8-8 8 3.59 8 8-3.59 8-8 8z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span data-en="Download on App Store" data-he="הורד ב-App Store">Download on App Store</span>
                </a>
                <ul class="project-list">
                    <li>
                        <span class="project-number">1</span>
                        <span data-en="Full-Cycle Production: Conceptualized, architected, and engineered a comprehensive 3D modeling mobile application completely from scratch, successfully launching it on the Apple App Store." data-he="ייצור מלא: תכנן, ארכיטקט ופיתח אפליקציית מידול תלת-ממדית מקיפה מאפס, והשיק בהצלחה ב-App Store.">Full-Cycle Production: Conceptualized, architected, and engineered a comprehensive 3D modeling mobile application completely from scratch, successfully launching it on the Apple App Store.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="project-number">2</span>
                        <span data-en="3D Graphics & Rendering: Implemented responsive, real-time 3D object rendering and custom mesh manipulation using SceneKit and developing standalone Constructive Solid Geometry (CSG) logic." data-he="גרפיקה תלת-ממדית: יישם רינדור תלת-ממדי בזמן אמת ומניפולציה מותאמת אישית של רשתות באמצעות SceneKit ופיתוח לוגיקה עצמאית של CSG.">3D Graphics & Rendering: Implemented responsive, real-time 3D object rendering and custom mesh manipulation using SceneKit and developing standalone Constructive Solid Geometry (CSG) logic.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="project-number">3</span>
                        <span data-en="UI/UX Framework: Built a modern, highly interactive fluid interface designed for precision workflows on iPadOS and iOS leveraging SwiftUI, custom layouts, and interactive gesture recognizers." data-he="ממשק משתמש: בנה ממשק מודרני ואינטראקטיבי המיועד ל-workflows מדויקים ב-iPadOS ו-iOS באמצעות SwiftUI.">UI/UX Framework: Built a modern, highly interactive fluid interface designed for precision workflows on iPadOS and iOS leveraging SwiftUI, custom layouts, and interactive gesture recognizers.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="project-number">4</span>
                        <span data-en="Data Pipelines: Engineered optimized data structures for storing complex 3D model scenes and integrated seamless multi-format export pipelines supporting standard industry formats (STL, GLB)." data-he="צינורות נתונים: תכנן מבני נתונים מותאמים לאחסון סצנות תלת-ממדיות מורכבות ושילב יצוא רב-פורמט (STL, GLB).">Data Pipelines: Engineered optimized data structures for storing complex 3D model scenes and integrated seamless multi-format export pipelines supporting standard industry formats (STL, GLB).</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="project-number">5</span>
                        <span data-en="App Store Lifecycle: Managed the end-to-end deployment pipeline via App Store Connect, handling metadata optimization, asset scaling, and successfully clearing rigorous Apple App Store review guidelines." data-he="ניהול App Store: ניהל את צינור הפריסה המלא דרך App Store Connect, כולל אופטימיזציה של מטא-דאטה ועמידה בתקני Apple.">App Store Lifecycle: Managed the end-to-end deployment pipeline via App Store Connect, handling metadata optimization, asset scaling, and successfully clearing rigorous Apple App Store review guidelines.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="experience-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title" data-en="Work Experience" data-he="ניסיון עבודה">Work Experience</h2>
            <div class="experience-card">
                <div class="experience-header">
                    <div>
                        <h3>ALTEGROSKY</h3>
                        <p class="role" data-en="B2B Sales Manager / Head of B2O Sales" data-he="מנהל מכירות B2B / ראש מכירות B2O">B2B Sales Manager / Head of B2O Sales</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="experience-period">2016 – 2025</span>
                </div>
                <p class="experience-description" data-en="The leading satellite communications operator in Eastern Europe (VSAT market leader)" data-he="מפעיל התקשורת הלוויינית המוביל במזרח אירופה (מוביל שוק VSAT)">The leading satellite communications operator in Eastern Europe (VSAT market leader)</p>
                <ul class="project-list">
                    <li>
                        <span class="project-number">1</span>
                        <span data-en="Strategic Growth: Developed advanced commercial and partnership models to expand satellite network infrastructure and coverage footprint into new geographic regions." data-he="צמיחה אסטרטגית: פיתח מודלים מסחריים מתקדמים להרחבת תשתית רשת לוויינית לאזורים גיאוגרפיים חדשים.">Strategic Growth: Developed advanced commercial and partnership models to expand satellite network infrastructure and coverage footprint into new geographic regions.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="project-number">2</span>
                        <span data-en="Partnership Management: Scaled regional B2O wholesale presence by successfully identifying, vetting, and onboarding strategic regional partners." data-he="ניהול שותפויות: הרחיב נוכחות סיטונאית אזורית B2O על ידי זיהוי, בדיקה ואינטגרציה של שותפים אסטרטגיים.">Partnership Management: Scaled regional B2O wholesale presence by successfully identifying, vetting, and onboarding strategic regional partners.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="project-number">3</span>
                        <span data-en="Business Development: Directed full-cycle enterprise B2B sales operations, maintaining high-value relationships with telecommunications operators and corporate clients." data-he="פיתוח עסקי: ניהל מחזור מלא של מכירות B2B ארגוניות, תוך שמירה על קשרים עם מפעילי תקשורת ולקוחות ארגוניים.">Business Development: Directed full-cycle enterprise B2B sales operations, maintaining high-value relationships with telecommunications operators and corporate clients.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="project-number">4</span>
                        <span data-en="Lead Acquisition: Proactively identified, targeted, and secured high-potential market prospects requiring customized satellite internet and data transmission solutions." data-he="רכישת לידים: זיהה ואבטח פרוספקטים בעלי פוטנציאל גבוה הזקוקים לפתרונות אינטרנט לווייני מותאמים אישית.">Lead Acquisition: Proactively identified, targeted, and secured high-potential market prospects requiring customized satellite internet and data transmission solutions.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="project-number">5</span>
                        <span data-en="Inbound Conversion: Optimized the conversion funnel for incoming warm leads using consultative value-based selling techniques to map technology solutions to corporate needs." data-he="המרת לידים: אופטימז את משפך ההמרה עבור לידים חמים באמצעות טכניקות מכירה מייעצות מבוססות ערך.">Inbound Conversion: Optimized the conversion funnel for incoming warm leads using consultative value-based selling techniques to map technology solutions to corporate needs.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

